<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian weekly forex demand falls to $80.09.</title>
<headline>Nigerian weekly forex demand falls to $80.09.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's Central Bank on Friday announced sales of forex at its latest weekly auction held on May 14th.</p>
<p>				     14 May		7 May</p>
<p> Amount sold		    $80.09 million	 $109.588 million</p>
<p> Dollar exchange rate	  85 naira	    85 naira</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
